{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Cookbook\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "psalm/phar is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/RecipeDb.php:544 OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::PARAM_DATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use PARAM_DATETIME_MUTABLE instead",
        "lib/Db/RecipeDb.php:545 OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::PARAM_DATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use PARAM_DATETIME_MUTABLE instead",
        "lib/Helper/UserConfigHelper.php:69 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly",
        "lib/Helper/UserConfigHelper.php:81 OCP\\IConfig::setUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "4 uses in 2 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 31 to 36. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Db/RecipeDb.php:544 OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::PARAM_DATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use PARAM_DATETIME_MUTABLE instead",
        "  lib/Db/RecipeDb.php:545 OCP\\DB\\QueryBuilder\\IQueryBuilder::PARAM_DATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 31; use PARAM_DATETIME_MUTABLE instead",
        "  lib/Helper/UserConfigHelper.php:69 OCP\\IConfig::getUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly",
        "  lib/Helper/UserConfigHelper.php:81 OCP\\IConfig::setUserValue(): deprecated since Nextcloud 33; use IUserConfig directly"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version000000Date20210701093123.php:33"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 transaction is opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version000000Date20210701093123.php:33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/RecipeDb.php:696 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "lib/Helper/Filter/DB/RecipeDatesFilter.php:90 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Helper/Filter/JSON/TimezoneFixFilter.php:54 new DateTime()",
        "lib/Service/DbCacheService.php:426 time()",
        "lib/Service/DbCacheService.php:430 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 5 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Db/RecipeDb.php:696 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "  lib/Helper/Filter/DB/RecipeDatesFilter.php:90 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Helper/Filter/JSON/TimezoneFixFilter.php:54 new DateTime()",
        "  lib/Service/DbCacheService.php:426 time()",
        "  lib/Service/DbCacheService.php:430 time()"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cors-unreferenced",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "GET /index.php/apps/cookbook/api/version  cookbook.util_api.getapiversion  appinfo/routes.php:45 routes"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 1 route outside OCS whose method allows requests from other origins (CORS), or that answers the preflight of such a request (OPTIONS). It is there for clients outside the app, so this is no defect in itself.",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/cookbook/api/version  cookbook.util_api.getapiversion  appinfo/routes.php:45 routes"
      ]
    }
